236:   /**
237:    * Specifies what should be done with the promised object when it becomes available.
238:    * <p>
239:    * <b>Important:</b> this method can only be used from a Ratpack managed compute thread.
240:    * If it is called on a non Ratpack managed compute thread it will immediately throw an {@link ExecutionException}.
241:    *
242:    * @param then the receiver of the promised value
243:    * @throws ExecutionException if not called on a Ratpack managed compute thread
244:    */
245:   void then(Action<? super T> then);
