370:     /**
371:      * Maximum size of the session cookie. If encrypted cookie exceeds it, it will be partitioned.
372:      * <p>
373:      * According to the <a href="http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2109.txt">RFC 2109</a> web cookies should be at least
374:      * 4096 bytes per cookie and at least 20 cookies per domain should be supported.
375:      * <p>
