232:   /**
233:    * Converts a {@link Promise} into a {@link Single}.
234:    * <p>
235:    * The returned Single emits the promise's single value if it succeeds, and emits the error (i.e. via {@code onError()}) if it fails.
236:    * <p>
237:    * This method works well as a method reference to the {@link Promise#to(ratpack.func.Function)} method.
238:    * <pre class="java">{@code
239:    * import ratpack.rx2.RxRatpack;
240:    * import ratpack.exec.Promise;
241:    * import ratpack.test.exec.ExecHarness;
242:    *
243:    * import static org.junit.Assert.assertEquals;
